## Project License

Project SPDX baseline: `GPL-3.0-only`

Rationale: this codebase imports `PyQt6` and `PyQt6-WebEngine`. Their PyPI
open-source distribution path is `GPL-3.0-only`, with a Riverbank commercial
license available as an alternative. For a public GitHub release without a
documented commercial PyQt entitlement, `GPL-3.0-only` is the compatible
open-source baseline.

The short project license notice is stored in `COPYING`. Before a public
release, the project owner should confirm the copyright holder name and whether
the repository should include the full GPL-3.0 license text.

## Copyright License Compliance Conclusion

Final assessment: compliant for open-source distribution if the repository and
release artifacts are distributed under `GPL-3.0-only` and include source,
