Important boundary: the same dependency set is not compatible with an MIT,
Apache-2.0, or proprietary-only project license unless the project owner has and
documents a valid Riverbank commercial license for PyQt/PyQt-WebEngine.

## Distribution Obligations

- Distribute the complete corresponding source for the released application.
- Keep `GPL-3.0-only` project license notice visible in the repository and
  release package.
- Preserve third-party license notices for PyQt6, PyQt6-WebEngine, requests,
<<<<<<< HEAD
  playwright, bundled fonts, and any packaged browser/runtime data.
- Keep OFL license files alongside redistributed font files under `fonts/open`.
