- If FFmpeg GPL binaries are bundled, include FFmpeg notices and source-offer
  information; if the app only downloads FFmpeg on demand, document that the
  user obtains FFmpeg from the upstream provider.
- Do not impose additional downstream restrictions that conflict with GPL-3.0.

