## Compatibility Details

| Dependency | Dependency License | Compatibility With Project GPL-3.0-only | Distribution Duty |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| PyQt6 | GPL-3.0-only or commercial | Compatible under GPL-3.0-only | Release project under GPL-3.0-only unless commercial PyQt license is used |
| PyQt6-WebEngine | GPL-3.0-only or commercial | Compatible under GPL-3.0-only | Same PyQt commercial/GPL boundary; Riverbank states PyQt-WebEngine is not LGPL |
| requests | Apache-2.0 | Compatible | Preserve Apache-2.0 license and notices |
| playwright | Apache-2.0 | Compatible | Preserve Apache-2.0 license and notices; track bundled browser assets separately |
